# Temporary collision-aware Ag-W interface precondition
units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p f
atom_modify sort 0 0
read_data /workspace/-/research/ag_w_reference_pack/models/ag_w_qsgs_200A/interface_reconstruction_v5/samephase_pair_precondition_screenbuffer/interface_precondition.data.gz
mass 1 183.84
mass 2 107.8682
pair_style hybrid/overlay soft 3.0 morse 3.0
pair_coeff 1 1 soft 50 2.70
pair_coeff 1 1 morse 1.0 2 2.74507789655 3.0
pair_coeff 1 2 soft 50 2.75
pair_coeff 1 2 morse 0.0 2 2.8 3.0
pair_coeff 2 2 soft 50 2.48
pair_coeff 2 2 morse 1.0 2 2.8881233396 3.0
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
group interface id 1:387507
group far id 387508:482601
group mobile union all
fix far_hold far setforce 0.0 0.0 0.0
fix bottomcap all wall/harmonic zlo 0.0 100.0 2.0 2.0
fix topcap all wall/harmonic zhi 200.0 100.0 2.0 2.0
variable fmag atom sqrt(fx*fx+fy*fy+fz*fz)
variable f2 atom fx*fx+fy*fy+fz*fz
compute fmax mobile reduce max v_fmag
compute f2mean mobile reduce ave v_f2
variable frms equal sqrt(c_f2mean)
thermo 100
thermo_style custom step pe c_fmax v_frms
thermo_modify flush yes
min_style fire
min_modify dmax 0.05
minimize 0.0 0.1 10000 50000
unfix far_hold
minimize 0.0 0.02 10000 50000
write_data geometry_precondition.data
write_dump all custom geometry_precondition.dump id type x y z fx fy fz modify sort id
